# Vercel AI Gateway's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-vercel-setting-api-key = An AI Gateway API key from the Vercel dashboard: AI Gateway > API Keys. The balance is the key's team, so use a key of the team to show.
